  "strings" : {
    "contactText" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Bei Fragen und Anregungen, schickt mir ne E-Mail"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you have any questions or suggestions, send me an email."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructionsText" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "1. Schreibe den Text, den du im QR Code codiert haben möchtest, in das Textfeld oben. Der QR Code ändert sich direkt während der Eingabe.\\n\\n2. Mit dem Button 'In Fotos speichern' passiert gebau das was drauf steht, der QR Code wird so wie er ist, als Bild, in der 'Fotos' App abgelegt, von dort aus kannst du ihn per Mail, iMessage, WhatsApp oder was auch immer verschicken."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Write the text you want to have encoded into a QR code in the text field above. The QR code changes as you type.\\n\\n2. When you click the 'Save to Photos' button, exactly what it is supposed to do happens: the QR code is saved as it is, as an image, in the 'Photos' app. From there you can send it by email, iMessage, WhatsApp or whatever."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "instructionsTitle" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Was musst du machen, um deinen QR Code zu erhalten?"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What do you have to do to get your QR code?"
          }
        }
      }
